vant details. This could help clarify any issues that might be happening. Let me see how that goes to ensure everything is running smoothly. It feels good to be thorough and make sure I'm on the right track!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我先查两件事：晨报相关配置/任务还在不在，以及 OpenClaw / Gateway 当前状态有没有异常。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf48f33de48191923a85852b15689d\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_xn5InR7HMuDrRECZ1jfXq9jN|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf48f4f2988191957749f8120d8266","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw status","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw status\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_en27rZtI8nnqqdfD1JPWPiY2|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf48f4f2a881918aa8ce8693b0ed8d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -RIn --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=.git -E \"晨报|morning report|briefing|9 点前|9点前|daily briefing|日报\" /root/.openclaw/workspace 2>/dev/null | head -200","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"grep -RIn --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=.git -E \\\"晨报|morning report|briefing|9 点前|9点前|daily briefing|日报\\\" /root/.openclaw/workspace 2>/dev/null | head -200\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":223,"output":199,"cacheRead":18048,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18470,"cost":{"input":0.0005575,"output":0.0029850000000000002,"cacheRead":0.0045119999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0080545}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774143728226}}
