{"type":"message","id":"5e9a3930","parentId":"e619bf67","timestamp":"2026-03-22T01:42:35.097Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Investigating command status**\n\nI'm considering whether the command is waiting due to interactivity issues. Maybe implementing a timeout could help. It seems like the status check might hang if the gateway is unreachable. I should inspect the processes closely to understand better. My next step will be to run a gateway status check and search the cron configuration to see if there's anything unusual. Let's explore this together and find a solution!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf4906c95881918ac158dfe780c1fa\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpv0kK4bAxmYQQHs1xKFClpsxlMLWhU0QJFVjuqCglJqH_5AJNPula2cGdDJuj24briM9LrLwHZPD2hEngJg8M1qDCul2tEptEAEvM8ZoYlbjSXHnt3tftnDeN98NH6AyoLQ0M19KzHpWFYjY86ZrkFqbRY6RmyC1-Iwd4VaK9ibcQ7A7Ktu1yP8IX3BkL6R0DR3nR5MMKZ5n7F-Kq5vFg1_Qn6WkwUPrxCCmlUPWOpoycvBAiF4MWbt6PBV164Zq2nZ5qll19nYc3Egz7A78Xxw85HaaUUUTUB-A49wb52s0DNUGUDGS4gRoJrqJbW5-9Z3pqlPiNhbj1SXbvUXkvRPp3GD2aPEW5KXLcoXyalBEJoYwWcKhh3_Vd1UsXUi8NDBm_ihOVzN5mGolYlZEq46bnVckends9-6CUuv2uXFn1Op2mDVhtvzuQgKg6iiqejW4aaJ7CvxyvsWq_qKaxc3a4MuPyZKy02hyW8RON3C3kTHJ7murhngimZxnpoHTx0Yp16FtUeiHcosx_W3EzNfoSaYl897fewT1Lm7n_flq652MwpOPtqcrA78JqjuEKKqnlO4qCye0FRHGArBdyf9bdWWhULhcdEVNY-Rl-O7Tgebdmwdtm-b3iXzsucaww3tjhNz3LX7t-6dhBSk8r3R6zVxekXOIyL5rA2k9OuOi9H0kGD5g7LwNTAAu7cJfyEYvoW7MkBkZwI4PKQ6jfdk45hOXnaRMGjeaVT40ZKJpDOqqg7L6rlyVy22X8sZdJxupxnXg5CI_SBqurnMQWYGfKu_4vTtCZAaWj88KNjdDs8igm6Uny9g4yvShAiGpsjE5u4BrSQ9deXyDIJ_xiqXnhfqboHIiBg0qxCCBVTn8ApR5vefESEh5jGeb3Htz-pG1jp1l4Bua9gVMR0vVXAlaPyT_nF-ecu7Ydi9cxnO5RvB6uEMM-Vr2jgQzcFvKmho2gXjIn3pvqzTkwM7XoIvLTqgzUqB-LfME7tqV4LXgQvuu1zl8VUBdZQn_v5X9sGnDNCU2Mpqexbvm5JZHxX3cYNyt1ghb3Jeg98oIMPuzk8mtOQLwhlWP2pZdOu4Zvf3f3\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Investigating command status**\\n\\nI'm considering whether the command is waiting due to interactivity issues. Maybe implementing a timeout could help. It seems like the status check might hang if the gateway is unreachable. I should inspect the processes closely to understand better. My next step will be to run a gateway status check and search the cron configuration to see if there's anything unusual. Let's explore this together and find a solution!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我继续往下查：重点看定时任务是不是根本没配上，或者服务虽然活着但 cron 没跑。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf490a270c81919130682e8152985a\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0PskTORYj6xeoJeBvTF3qBqM|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf490ae4608191a9213e80af6c717a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw gateway status","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw gateway status\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_OiNsDyfq6Qk7KCQUb7bu5WHo|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf490ae46c8191b3f19e7b2ec07d3c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -RIn --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=.git -E \"cron|schedule|Morning briefing|briefing\" /root/.openclaw/workspace /root/.config /root/.openclaw 2>/dev/null | head -300","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"grep -RIn --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=.git -E \\\"cron|schedule|Morning briefing|briefing\\\" /root/.openclaw/workspace /root/.config /root/.openclaw 2>/dev/null | head -300\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":331,"output":225,"cacheRead":20224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20780,"cost":{"input":0.0008275000000000001,"output":0.003375,"cacheRead":0.005056,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0092585}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774143749824}}
