config/systemd/user/openclaw-gateway.service\nService env: OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PORT=34459\n\nService config looks out of date or non-standard.\nService config issue: Gateway service uses Node from a version manager; it can break after upgrades. (/root/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.1/bin/node)\nService config issue: System Node 22+ not found; install it before migrating away from version managers.\nRecommendation: run \"openclaw doctor\" (or \"openclaw doctor --repair\").\nConfig (cli): ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\nConfig (service): ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n\nGateway: bind=lan (0.0.0.0), port=34459 (service args)\nProbe target: ws://127.0.0.1:34459\nDashboard: http://10.3.0.12:34459/afpkti/\nProbe note: bind=lan listens on 0.0.0.0 (all interfaces); probing via 127.0.0.1.\n\nRuntime: running (pid 2683927, state active, sub running, last exit 0, reason 0)\nRPC probe: ok\n\nListening: *:34459\nTroubles: run openclaw status\nTroubleshooting: https://docs.openclaw.ai/troubleshooting","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774143760080}}
{"type":"message","id":"b2955f89","parentId":"9a4ad817","timestamp":"2026-03-22T01:42:40.544Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_OiNsDyfq6Qk7KCQUb7bu5WHo|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf490ae46c8191b3f19e7b2ec07d3c","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:2:name: briefing\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:3:description: \"Daily briefing: gathers calendar (gcalcli-calendar), active todos (todo-management), and weather (openmeteo-sh-weather-simple) into a concise summary.\"\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:10:Compose a daily briefing using companion skills. Each source is optional — skip it if the skill is not available.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:20:If **none** of the three are available — tell the user you have nothing to build a briefing from and stop. Do not fabricate a briefing.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:26:- Day still active -> briefing covers **today**.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:27:- Day winding down -> briefing covers **tomorrow**.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:38:2. Fetch the **briefing day's** agenda.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:49:1. Get the **briefing day's** conditions and forecast. Use the user's default city/country from session context.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:64:1. **Title line** — compact: date, day-of-week, time. E.g. `Брифинг 14.02 (пт, 8:12)`. If briefing day is tomorrow, say so.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:66:3. **Calendar** — briefing day's events, chronologically. Format: `HH:MM — Title`. All-day events first. If empty: one line noting no events.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:113:- When briefing day is tomorrow, calendar and weather headers should reflect that.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md:122:- No call to action or question at the end. The briefing ends after the last section. No \"What's next?\", \"What's first?\", or similar.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:1:# briefing\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:3:A daily briefing skill for OpenClaw. Gathers calendar events, active todos, and weather into a single concise message — optimized for mobile chat.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:7:When invoked (typically via `/briefing`), the agent:\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:10:2. Determines whether the briefing covers **today** or **tomorrow** (based on current time and remaining events).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:18:This skill orchestrates three companion skills. All are optional — the briefing adapts to whatever is available.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:21:- [**`todo-management`**](https://clawhub.ai/lstpsche/todo-management) — Active/pending todo items. Provides task list for the briefing.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:44:If the briefing produces poor results, try a more capable model before adjusting the skill.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:64:This skill is triggered by the user via `/briefing` command. It is also available for the agent to invoke when contextually appropriate (e.g. as part of a scheduled cron job).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:66:## Recommended: scheduled daily briefing\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:68:This skill works best as a **scheduled cron job** that fires every morning at your wake time. Instead of manually typing `/briefing` each day, let OpenClaw send it for you.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:73:openclaw cron add \\\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:74:  --name \"Morning briefing\" \\\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:75:  --cron \"0 7 * * *\" \\\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:78:  --message 'Use the \"briefing\" skill for this request.' \\\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:84:- `--cron \"0 7 * * *\"` — 07:00 daily. Change the hour/minute to match your wake time. Uses standard [cron syntax](https://crontab.guru/).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:87:- `--channel` — the channel where the briefing should be delivered (e.g. `telegram`, `discord`, `slack`).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:93:openclaw cron list\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:98:- This uses OpenClaw's built-in cron scheduler — no external tools or system crontabs needed.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:99:- The cron job sends `/briefing` as a user message, which triggers the skill normally.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/README.md:101:- If the gateway restarts, cron jobs are reloaded automatically from `~/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json`.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/_meta.json:3:  \"slug\": \"briefing\",\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/src/gep/a2aProtocol.js:483:function _scheduleNextHeartbeat(delayMs) {\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/src/gep/a2aProtocol.js:490:    _scheduleNextHeartbeat();\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/src/gep/a2aProtocol.js:556:          _scheduleNextHeartbeat(backoff);\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/src/gep/a2aProtocol.js:665:    _scheduleNextHeartbeat(Math.max(30000, _heartbeatIntervalMs));\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/src/gep/prompt.js:558:  {\"result\":\"success\",\"en\":\"Status: [INNOVATION] Created auto-scheduler that syncs calendar to HEARTBEAT.md\",\"zh\":\"状态: [创新] 创建了自动调度器，将日历同步到 HEARTBEAT.md\"}\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/src/ops/innovation.js:23:        'automation': skills.filter(s => s.includes('auto-') || s.includes('scheduler') || s.includes('cron')).length,\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/test/signals.test.js:154:    const long = 'I want to add a feature that allows users to export data in CSV and Excel formats, with custom column mapping, date range filters, scheduled exports, email delivery, and integration with our analytics pipeline so that we can reduce manual reporting work. This is critical for Q2.';\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.zh-CN.md:77:如果你通过 cron 或外部调度器定期触发 evolver，建议使用单条简单命令，避免嵌套引号：\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.zh-CN.md:85:避免在 cron payload 中拼接多个 shell 片段（例如 `...; echo EXIT:$?`），因为嵌套引号在经过多层序列化/转义后容易出错。\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.zh-CN.md:231:- [Golden-Koi](https://github.com/Golden-Koi) -- 为 README 新增 cron/外部调度器保活最佳实践 (PR #167)。\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/SKILL.md:137:To run in an infinite loop (e.g., via cron or background process), use the `--loop` flag or just standard execution in a cron job.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/SKILL.md:267:- **Git Sync**: Always recommended to have a git-sync cron job running alongside this skill.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.md:133:If you run a periodic keepalive/tick from a cron/agent runner, prefer a single simple command with minimal quoting.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.md:141:Avoid composing multiple shell segments inside the cron payload (for example `...; echo EXIT:$?`) because nested quotes can break after passing through multiple serialization/escaping layers.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.md:146:pm2 start \"bash -lc 'node index.js --loop'\" --name evolver --cron-restart=\"0 */6 * * *\"\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver/README.md:282:- [Golden-Koi](https://github.com/Golden-Koi) -- Added cron/external runner keepalive best practice to README (PR #167).\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/.skills_store_lock.json:82:    \"briefing\": {\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/.skills_store_lock.json:84:      \"zip_url\": \"https://lightmake.site/api/v1/download?slug=briefing\",\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/.clawhub/lock.json:68:    \"briefing\": {\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/evolution/gep_prompt_Cycle_#0001_run_1774061229457.txt:552:  {\"result\":\"success\",\"en\":\"Status: [INNOVATION] Created auto-scheduler that syncs calendar to HEARTBEAT.md\",\"zh\":\"状态: [创新] 创建了自动调度器，将日历同步到 HEARTBEAT.md\"}\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.bash:9:    opts=\"completion setup onboard configure config backup doctor dashboard reset uninstall message memory agent agents status health sessions browser acp gateway daemon logs system models approvals nodes devices node sandbox tui cron dns docs hooks webhooks qr clawbot pairing plugins channels directory security secrets skills update -V, --dev --profile --log-level --no-color\"\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.bash:162:      cron)\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:31:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_use_subcommand\" -a \"cron\" -d 'Manage cron jobs (via Gateway)'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:440:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from event\" -a \"list\" -d 'List scheduled events'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:441:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from event\" -a \"create\" -d 'Create a scheduled event'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1354:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from cron\" -a \"status\" -d 'Show cron scheduler status'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1355:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from cron\" -a \"list\" -d 'List cron jobs'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1356:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from cron\" -a \"add\" -d 'Add a cron job'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1357:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from cron\" -a \"rm\" -d 'Remove a cron job'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1358:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from cron\" -a \"enable\" -d 'Enable a cron job'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1359:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from cron\" -a \"disable\" -d 'Disable a cron job'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1360:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from cron\" -a \"runs\" -d 'Show cron run history (JSONL-backed)'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1361:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from cron\" -a \"run\" -d 'Run a cron job now (debug)'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1362:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from cron\" -a \"edit\" -d 'Edit a cron job (patch fields)'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1385:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from add\" -l cron -d 'Cron expression (5-field or 6-field with seconds)'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1386:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from add\" -l tz -d 'Timezone for cron expressions (IANA)'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1388:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from add\" -l exact -d 'Disable cron staggering (set stagger to 0)'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1445:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from edit\" -l cron -d 'Set cron expression'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1446:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from edit\" -l tz -d 'Timezone for cron expressions (IANA)'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.fish:1448:complete -c openclaw -n \"__fish_seen_subcommand_from edit\" -l exact -d 'Disable cron staggering (set stagger to 0)'\n/root/.openclaw/completions/openclaw.ps1:20:         $completions = @('completion','setup','onboard','configure','config','backup','doctor','dashboard','reset','uninstall','message','memory','agent','agents','status','health','sessions','browser','acp','gateway','d