\nI need to make some fixes. Maybe I should use my skills here? It looks like I’m dealing with an OpenClaw configuration task. I definitely need to confirm that I've got the user's consent before deleting anything destructive. Maybe I should open the OpenClaw docs locally to check things? I think I might need help with adding or editing a cron job, so inspecting the current format could be a good idea!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我直接修：先备份旧 cron，再按当前版本重建两个任务，最后跑一次验证。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf529622ac8191ae7d01981ae07a67\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_FLcKCYLarTPPazXdEglW8UZw|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf529775888191b130aad7bf7ad419","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron add --help","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw cron add --help\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_NdmSOk6ihvSac9XlQwvwAh8k|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf5297759881919aceeb1f0a35e89a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron edit --help","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw cron edit --help\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_nKRY3n26m0jQmJcheGcC5Cjd|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf529775a0819186309fa465482877","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron run --help","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw cron run --help\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":35849,"output":230,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36079,"cost":{"input":0.08962250000000001,"output":0.00345,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0930725}},"stopReaso