{"type":"message","id":"8610b094","parentId":"71dcc90e","timestamp":"2026-03-22T02:23:52.434Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf52b594ac8191b9138208017f2ecc\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpv1K4DflQTGl2ssm-vJOcECFJ_RU7SqI2-G0v7jeNc0zyInnW1AAjQKraELISnM8r7N_okJj9diuKMvTzgeoKB2T67Ir6sA6L6G56XxQerrffWXh6tnAXooih_kzuTENN9VYy47C2Ye8jAG_8XGG6w5jgGjBLqORR9JhwK2XfgndJJlRS8pGTOEAT-SC-VZk0m_4XKn_CeNavWncnI3vCWHo32PaTJ43ngJknghFG2yUg4vhND_tkDudeASNcpX-I2eAPWRCdg5r58T-wRbuKw83UnxhdHORQErBI9QBo4KPB23DkIg5dezxO3IhjXr2k6ua3EHb_jcdKwXE58HfBash1P3UNC1U8P7fcoQNiP2fTyw8F1FtAGyOSKoHXS3417_SGO45DrqoX2ATQ3QIRgydZITeoRUq-qdpTdM01_AiXV80iXqi7DuWJT1jaDann4ZWmeh2CYtn9c7gc-nxidiKloyVE6FITohvnNm8fPw-vbDhf8jm-pxavt4qwhMsouKaGK3Uw5AmMZRHyWqRU53_5lj_siTRAupPjk1VVBLg2eWVyT9kcpo8VL8ONzFJCax0TlUj-fg-OlAyGnbrZAMYzsuspcdQsOl0RRptqlSHsw6zKp_nQAfkBu3ydkAUxb0vv5PsqwLRU2Rs49GS9NfTIy0nbCKyywIDCCxtjyUtJsxuHYQEriVbiSfspRJEep_Hq5m86tWFVyXgQbhJlvKvfkMgp7abiqJLfR6HAr0gavstctiYTbOy3BBwH4AXjjF4PQxbtYSM2smP8Pt17uoZKOlzV1SIoxiAq0d7eJbPh3DpxVBuTGTMfdShopVfGMfPwT6IQIKTvXniVVqYU_DH58g6dMeoRDpA6_Y-1VPHLdoo=\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1ZhJF1t4g60RlO1e1VrpsYfQ|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf52b82fd881918a528caf050ba51a","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/automation/cron-jobs.md","offset":115,"limit":140},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/automation/cron-jobs.md\",\"offset\":115,\"limit\":140}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":8089,"output":116,"cacheRead":38144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46349,"cost":{"input":0.0202225,"output":0.00174,"cacheRead":0.009536,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0314985}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774146226763}}
{"type":"message","id":"0adc7db8","parentId":"8610b094","timestamp":"2026-03-22T02:23:52.450Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_1ZhJF1t4g60RlO1e1VrpsYfQ|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf52b82fd881918a528caf050ba51a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- `cron`：5 字段 cron 表达式，可选 IANA 时区。\n\nCron 表达式使用 `croner`。如果省略时区，将使用 Gateway网关主机的本地时区。\n\n### 主会话与隔离式执行\n\n#### 主会话任务（系统事件）\n\n主会话任务入队一个系统事件，并可选择唤醒心跳运行器。它们必须使用 `payload.kind = \"systemEvent\"`。\n\n- `wakeMode: \"next-heartbeat\"`（默认）：事件等待下一次计划心跳。\n- `wakeMode: \"now\"`：事件触发立即心跳运行。\n\n当你需要正常的心跳提示 + 主会话上下文时，这是最佳选择。参见[心跳](/gateway/heartbeat)。\n\n#### 隔离任务（专用定时会话）\n\n隔离任务在会话 `cron:<jobId>` 中运行专用智能体轮次。\n\n关键行为：\n\n- 提示以 `[cron:<jobId> <任务名称>]` 为前缀，便于追踪。\n- 每次运行都会启动一个**全新的会话 ID**（不继承之前的对话）。\n- 如果未指定 `delivery`，隔离任务会默认以“announce”方式投递摘要。\n- `delivery.mode` 可选 `announce`（投递摘要）或 `none`（内部运行）。\n\n对于嘈杂、频繁或\"后台杂务\"类任务，使用隔离任务可以避免污染你的主聊天记录。\n\n### 负载结构（运行内容）\n\n支持两种负载类型：\n\n- `systemEvent`：仅限主会话，通过心跳提示路由。\n- `agentTurn`：仅限隔离会话，运行专用智能体轮次。\n\n常用 `agentTurn` 字段：\n\n- `message`：必填文本提示。\n- `model` / `thinking`：可选覆盖（见下文）。\n- `timeoutSeconds`：可选超时覆盖。\n\n### 模型和思维覆盖\n\n隔离任务（`agentTurn`）可以覆盖模型和思维级别：\n\n- `model`：提供商/模型字符串（例如 `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-20250514`）或别名（例如 `opus`）\n- `thinking`：思维级别（`off`、`minimal`、`low`、`medium`、`high`、`xhigh`；仅限 GPT-5.2 + Codex 模型）\n\n注意：你也可以在主会话任务上设置 `model`，但这会更改共享的主会话模型。我们建议仅对隔离任务使用模型覆盖，以避免意外的上下文切换。\n\n优先级解析顺序：\n\n1. 任务负载覆盖（最高优先级）\n2. 钩子特定默认值（例如 `hooks.gmail.model`）\n3. 智能体配置默认值\n\n### 投递（渠道 + 目标）\n\n隔离任务可以通过顶层 `delivery` 配置投递输出：\n\n- `delivery.mode`：`announce`（投递摘要）或 `none`\n- `delivery.channel`：`whatsapp` / `telegram` / `discord` / `slack` / `mattermost`（插件）/ `signal` / `imessage` / `last`\n- `delivery.to`：渠道特定的接收目标\n- `delivery.bestEffort`：投递失败时避免任务失败\n\n当启用 announce 投递时，该轮次会抑制消息工具发送；请使用 `delivery.channel`/`delivery.to` 来指定目标。\n\n如果省略 `delivery.channel` 或 `delivery.to`，定时任务会回退到主会话的“最后路由”（智能体最后回复的位置）。\n\n目标格式提醒：\n\n- Slack/Discord/Mattermost（插件）目标应使用明确前缀（例如 `channel:<id>`、`user:<id>`）以避免歧义。\n- Telegram 主题应使用 `:topic:` 格式（见下文）。\n\n#### Telegram 投递目标（主题/论坛帖子）\n\nTelegram 通过 `message_thread_id` 支持论坛主题。对于定时任务投递，你可以将主题/帖子编码到 `to` 字段中：\n\n- `-1001234567890`（仅聊天 ID）\n- `-1001234567890:topic:123`（推荐：明确的主题标记）\n- `-1001234567890:123`（简写：数字后缀）\n\n带前缀的目标如 `telegram:...` / `telegram:group:...` 也可接受：\n\n- `telegram:group:-1001234567890:topic:123`\n\n## 工具调用的 JSON 模式\n\n直接调用 Gateway网关 `cron.*` 工具（智能体工具调用或 RPC）时使用这些结构。CLI 标志接受人类可读的时间格式如 `20m`，但工具调用应使用 ISO 8601 字符串作为 `schedule.at`，并使用毫秒作为 `schedule.everyMs`。\n\n### cron.add 参数\n\n一次性主会话任务（系统事件）：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Reminder\",\n  \"schedule\": { \"kind\": \"at\", \"at\": \"2026-02-01T16:00:00Z\" },\n  \"sessionTarget\": \"main\",\n  \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n  \"payload\": { \"kind\": \"systemEvent\", \"text\": \"Reminder text\" },\n  \"deleteAfterRun\": true\n}\n```\n\n带投递的周期性隔离任务：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Morning brief\",\n  \"schedule\": { \"kind\": \"cron\", \"expr\": \"0 7 * * *\", \"tz\": \"America/Los_Angeles\" },\n  \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n  \"wakeMode\": \"next-heartbeat\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n    \"message\": \"Summarize overnight updates.\"\n  },\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"mode\": \"announce\",\n    \"channel\": \"slack\",\n    \"to\": \"channel:C1234567890\",\n    \"bestEffort\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n说明：\n\n- `schedule.kind`：`at`（`at`）、`every`（`everyMs`）或 `cron`（`expr`，可选 `tz`）。\n- `schedule.at` 接受 ISO 8601（可省略时区；省略时按 UTC 处理）。\n- `everyMs` 为毫秒数。\n- `sessionTarget` 必须为 `\"main\"` 或 `\"isolated\"`，且必须与 `payload.kind` 匹配。\n- 可选字段：`agentId`、`description`、`enabled`、`deleteAfterRun`、`delivery`。\n- `wakeMode` 省略时默认为 `\"next-heartbeat\"`。\n\n### cron.update 参数\n\n```json\n{\n  \"jobId\": \"job-123\",\n\n[171 more lines in file. Use offset=255 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774146232441}}
{"type":"message","id":"0d1b981c","parentId":"0adc7db8","timestamp":"2026-03-22T02:24:00.362Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Creating temporary job configurations**\n\nI think it might be easiest to create temporary valid jobs through the command line with the desired configurations. I wonder if I should edit the IDs or names afterwards, or if I should just keep what gets generated. It’s important for me to know if the system allows duplicates with existing names. For now, I’ll start by creating one probe in an isolated and disabled state to see how it all works.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf52b9aac88191a4b68add57951e87\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpv1LAXaw7txCmFdP6UHRfgkvXVuhSmUBOTOYvYv4xcjA1IqY9qtpAAbVs_D3XJNL8jfRfHIyFdMjNlPGUyzQH3puTNvigZoqVwaCrxiphC0S0UlHUjKcMQOPNkJWDqMO3L-JwkIif_VHzymqzoBJp5nRTzPbqceNVPztIWapjbYLkOO7I-o9RO7awm_fvLBCL8fO4_4FO90fNzJWEqi7E3_jfdquwaZhEd5Zk5fpWEhOemq3oIAmsHDiYlfUevJDnKPwyL_uas_PE9tUbB06BFwAVjDhEjR8qiY2-3Nw_m7GXwBO7pwQCSJve-8hszgKeq-k6GBwAq_1-YyRm5_79RScXP9-lOQnfhd1cBukJw-mKLhj0qorG7Lk6QGW6wnDyZA0bTQOUJaFdfcSVgbpp7ug4w20e6TeirSJ1bdy4KuGXlwm0AZxDDZhzRi5sLSbmoy-lcpU2EhqxM13ABWhXDqq_JB-OhLseQq63KLA6ME9JEDgXfVlweazdHrdM7im2KLjZKYRtcoYPkzU4bQ2x_Gz_N8nb0fUiE3tnohu2Zrt6hFYTL6etY2MC1GC0zbKodISdeBXNDIqPf88NmjT5t6dpjqOB83UUvD3Qd06MfPtjJJX9PLiybCowJcjjxdGjOocV--RBEJ47zXqlHEcb0bb1zPkjCqsVWT1GhqWqUC7VVS5Z4l_LUX3VdNo9S6QUcbfRWwylkm_1Z4HpC_Iqax5SUczSs8A7YTeLHxoHDKm5si3r3AcHW7SQQSHHBUP2KRBW1Wn0J29dkqIcnMau1bU3kLQUZvgVBdzFQWGEtxwX0Bri9GwaqqTwcTWrb23239DvEcHQCJBtFV6SzcJq39VQjUggYH8r8EAPS-PWIfsqWnd0R9pa7MgRXSGCTHpoOW_NnIf_eJBfviv23him0ryi3CkJKDhYZh3kHQZ1IKjAofPWHKjRTQ3Db_sos8FOq5vJx-0kIXZMTW-BlE3jOz5kd6nMLzPzRKDspIoC4ypnFrH9EMtsuqdAAe0Z6_PAI4cg8oKs4Mf5erSXgZf85CoEG4JaC_1XkUH0kl9R6feV6C5tIdcq1KcE1RdSSscMAobgVlvZivBjDfm-9uK42NJHiK6bFr10dc5x1i8_Af3RFn3P6HFqhF6JLnv68RxAE9oSO6JH2Tf3KSH_SGNKwM2tiolCH2oy_PKq0cKhK8pUjfgmgejWT0CUQkIZhtpd0KLisA0-U29mi8kYWAc9uOky9no