{"type":"message","id":"fd30553c","parentId":"c78b806a","timestamp":"2026-03-22T02:24:07.150Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Inspecting job data**\n\nI need to check the jobs.json file to see if it includes both old and new entries. It's important to confirm that I have the complete data set, as understanding the changes over time could be essential for my analysis. Maybe I’ll look for any patterns or discrepancies between the old and new data. Let’s dive in and explore the contents to ensure everything is as it should be!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf52c4e338819184db44c21bf64cd3\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpv1LGDWSj0zmEXaDONXMlgrMXffvgEjqOxCmfJu0YsgXEDezC0NUy7J74oRkkwYViVJo-0u0exiKKHNv-EkGSSo3dKRQLVmCpenB_vacSbJxnbb42l0X6gyf4kN7DQjBkPCOFVO7-W8p6dfYvsj05Aa0y9Uh_xLlfeudjBCdgMPLoX6ve9xgxTm3KPNqarYUrSvxRDfIz3RC5_ZUXXkkgYkcCer-ysvj-pjVEldXdwk_W2U_CgAcDvy_G7w16Y6f6WrfMPovl9NZf3yNLibDJH9x2UUgqd1POG_CQZabLnAKlrQx9VuOVDOI_KAXIf-iLw03egF8tETh4AHhL79uCATAyUwAe4kiGHNoyxFxmpbPYWJ5-jLdTfLkO4uLIdCRAdeih8oFfeACqQSLVUK5r6aL83PAAzxjQYXaEiR_Kfv4tPqz2XSYJ88XCk5ba7y2MugQIdeOEyzwU2GeeWu9aacg9MQax209CDcsv-UwvxViXMNIri-sVOifQ-5qT7XzE0qX3905YuyBZ9Va6QwnjMnjjcAz1upwuOWrxaMevs7Mrvz5HOROPyny81xBk16u5u1PnnOUiSGu8M2YrBbRjjM2JUQPA34f9rhSWgLGDVA_NRbXu7ITjZFCjvWy_713vpEL38NdXqYFiZV8hOAi8TjWfQUCo4O_QPTZePZayLBtlU7gzgvFcNiW-k_xKBkFyAWNRDwC7y53-I6yjfcUxLR779UgUrTI35QS5BzxTfL_JoUSR3otbFTcjI1KSSTms8fDVJECFPajDJkqn_Nc_W9x73mLV-0x2p0z2ah3VmWeCafWgfH4YHZbvE1Rgz3qMBKSB-WOikbPD-YqWP4VjIS0DB9LaN2IxgZE-XHMproLgbrEMxFNpIcf7GWGLXyBICdX6\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Inspecting job data**\\n\\nI need to check the jobs.json file to see if it includes both old and new entries. It's important to confirm that I have the complete data set, as understanding the changes over time could be essential for my analysis. Maybe I’ll look for any patterns or discrepancies between the old and new data. Le