{"type":"message","id":"d83ee49d","parentId":"0510c6bf","timestamp":"2026-03-22T02:24:34.320Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering sample creation**\n\nI'm thinking I might need to create a sample manually, focusing on two jobs with existing stable IDs. Timestamps could be good to have, though maybe not strictly required. I can use the current milliseconds for that. A Python script seems like a great idea to handle this, and I want to make sure the output is valid JSON. Direct writing could simplify the process. Let’s make sure it all works smoothly!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf52d4c7c08191ab3a7c61c7f9d299\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpv1LXBSC3kxJy_ZJTAPq0GMGnV5ITQEJSYQtxHebCJj1wg1u19AyDPNz-maaxOZ9oDVQKxDOxvl31Jl7Quq3GUApOKKI7o6IM5WpyDQU--Dxw0i-xM9LdPIk1mcDFI9U65E2KT4AqQeyZflZM-yR2KzD_XxcZuCzuISp3UveyI9G6Rrve-QEk5aiOPjR3SnIgSogapWpCLVvlGx6wBLuwPsIG-VoUGiYvm6knlFtwf_XQD4Qik6XsG_a5vH7JDJuq-umLFj59llV-eAPifZiimsUSbtNqoqeeKhNYMf3nwb9zDMy6yG2VZGK7NA79ZqGXFuF6zofyOBiRLQ00sDDL6ZQV7-paBEnFzCS3prE8EPSWynCaLLuEQ-LuC_m0jpt58j-Pi5BeI3Jb6t4JNErvaP7jqG1nXuSonkGtE7vWgB9mleKn3V2xmyFajg3EbBVvcQjicaQr4w2INfG4MzsueiuTADCZvNiWyH_2r4x3QwTkT5tKShQgQZdcTwCQPn84hJzQmXPqbdIQCJEGCn_RYqbvua3SGdrUmZndcF2ksKEWhSOO1fjwQWrDUWv5lb2-mOQlFYCZw--l89wDNncCiS0FdQ_8d_E5o7fGPXaQyQgp9gLzzRVF5pVPvioNx8NgaC3wIOSOabP1fcWZ8qQwl82b760xtdGJTgNucSduqiTitpvVAu_CA0WqT42ebmqwJJkUsDHFb4tLn0bfbJHVH-2N8mqPc1lJ_UUuDvPQzUx1GPFuxSvD3hBqCs9DxfLIUht1NPyYqzzOA1wRlk5MudxKsdanFgQNMsWqWI08CQnIwCw7QYx33asyKwcPqM-_nM8nWrW_8s_4LF--KoPvkCmXpu5ysErZL9hYSVq71iAzkbrR3CpnlBgDxhV-FCp0kQ8n4AZfyvz2z2bT3iNrh32hJteje1TJraGmNasIOtRrHJN2Ks4huRI4UqgsjtLh95Q_ud2LvcYqU0lhH4vdcpQh5e6-XZ4np52Se3JBYorvyxbfU8ebGJrEHR4_Qfu3QvjxN_TGSfHJbi7qv6sILHTd5n37XOB9B-3ZQQCCoKk--MS__e0Em3oRYm3glwcZpzI0CawxlIqnCKi-qRsu3U2rU_vG0VMrafU7lnXP_jo_pznH88ggjc2Pq-07zZ1_ROjheV_SzSew1Vbiu7G6EcUtzQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering sample creation**\\n\\nI'm thinking I might need to create a sample manually, focusing on two jobs with existing stable IDs. Timestamps could be good to have, though maybe not strictly required. I can use the current milliseconds for that. A Python script seems like a great idea to handle this, and I want to make sure the output is valid JSON. Direct writing could simplify the process. Let’s make sure it all works smoothly!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我已经确认新格式了。现在把旧任务替换成可执行的新格式，并把投递目标绑到你当前这个飞书会话。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf52d7a388819185d88b02eabd106c\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_qC8E0tEw1IOKTfOqRDUwUWrh|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf52d7b26c8191b8c65abbc0be85b5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json, time\nnow = int(time.time()*1000)\nuser = 'user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8'\njobs = {\n  'version': 1,\n  'jobs': [\n    {\n      'id': 'morning-briefing',\n      'name': '每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报',\n      'enabled': True,\n      'createdAtMs': now,\n      'updatedAtMs': now,\n      'schedule': {\n        'kind': 'cron',\n        'expr': '0 8 * * *',\n        'tz': 'Asia/Shanghai'\n      },\n      'sessionTarget': 'isolated',\n      'wakeMode': 'now',\n      'payload': {\n        'kind': 'agentTurn',\n        'message': '执行 briefing 技能获取天气、日历与待办；然后访问 InStreet 社区获取值得关注的热门讨论；整合成一份简洁、可执行、适合手机阅读的晨报，并直接发送给主人。严格结论先行，少废话，不要编造信息。'\n      },\n      'delivery': {\n        'mode': 'announce',\n        'channel': 'feishu',\n        'to': user,\n        'accountId': 'default'\n      },\n      'state': {}\n    },\n    {\n      'id': 'memory-daily-create',\n      'name': '每日自动创建日记',\n      'enabled': True,\n      'createdAtMs': now,\n      'updatedAtMs': now,\n      'schedule': {\n        'kind': 'cron',\n        'expr': '0 0 * * *',\n        'tz': 'Asia/Shanghai'\n      },\n      'sessionTarget': 'isolated',\n      'wakeMode': 'now',\n      'payload': {\n        'kind': 'agentTurn',\n        'message': '检查并创建当天的 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md 日记文件；如果文件已存在则不要重复创建；除非出现异常，否则不要向用户发送任何消息。'\n      },\n      'delivery': {\n        'mode': 'none'\n      },\n      'state': {}\n    }\n  ]\n}\npath = '/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json'\nwith open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    json.dump(jobs, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n    f.write('\\n')\nprint(path)\nPY","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json, time\\nnow = int(time.time()*1000)\\nuser = 'user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8'\\njobs = {\\n  'version': 1,\\n  'jobs': [\\n    {\\n      'id': 'morning-briefing',\\n      'name': '每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报',\\n      'enabled': True,\\n      'createdAtMs': now,\\n      'updatedAtMs': now,\\n      'schedule': {\\n        'kind': 'cron',\\n        'expr': '0 8 * * *',\\n        'tz': 'Asia/Shanghai'\\n      },\\n      'sessionTarget': 'isolated',\\n      'wakeMode': 'now',\\n      'payload': {\\n        'kind': 'agentTurn',\\n        'message': '执行 briefing 技能获取天气、日历与待办；然后访问 InStreet 社区获取值得关注的热门讨论；整合成一份简洁、可执行、适合手机阅读的晨报，并直接发送给主人。严格结论先行，少废话，不要编造信息。'\\n      },\\n      'delivery': {\\n        'mode': 'announce',\\n        'channel': 'feishu',\\n        'to': user,\\n        'accountId': 'default'\\n      },\\n      'state': {}\\n    },\\n    {\\n      'id': 'memory-daily-create',\\n      'name': '每日自动创建日记',\\n      'enabled': True,\\n      'createdAtMs': now,\\n      'updatedAtMs': now,\\n      'schedule': {\\n        'kind': 'cron',\\n        'expr': '0 0 * * *',\\n        'tz': 'Asia/Shanghai'\\n      },\\n      'sessionTarget': 'isolated',\\n      'wakeMode': 'now',\\n      'payload': {\\n        'kind': 'agentTurn',\\n        'message': '检查并创建当天的 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md 日记文件；如果文件已存在则不要重复创建；除非出现异常，否则不要向用户发送任何消息。'\\n      },\\n      'delivery': {\\n        'mode': 'none'\\n      },\\n      'state': {}\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\npath = '/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json'\\nwith open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    json.dump(jobs, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\\n    f.write('\\\\n')\\nprint(path)\\nPY\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":373,"output":744,"cacheRead":49024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50141,"cost":{"input":0.0009325000000000001,"output":0.01116,"cacheRead":0.012256,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0243485}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774146257052}}
