t\",\"text\":\"**Investigating cron runs**\\n\\nI need to find out why there's likely no run history. Maybe it’s because the cron job got enqueued but the queue worker isn’t processing it? The logs show that the cron started, but I don't see any details for manual runs. Could it be that the manual run is queued to a session and is waiting? I should check the session list for the cron job labeled \\\"morning-briefing\\\" to gather more information.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我再补一刀确认：看是否生成了 `cron:morning-briefing` 会话，还是压根没起 agent。这个能直接区分“执行没启动”还是“启动后没投递”。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf5488750c81919c41c16c8cc7b7e7\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4AmzrGd5KtfjR1Y12CTCs4hS|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf54896cf8819180349ef209f8728b","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"limit":50,"messageLimit":2},"partialJson":"{\"limit\":50,\"messageLimit\":2}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Mxzm5zvPIIc9WrtONynPkgDW|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf54896d0881918d28cfa71f470a0a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron runs --id morning-briefing --limit 20","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw cron runs --id morning-briefing --limit 20\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":17979,"output":208,"cacheRead":111232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":129419,"cost":{"input":0.0449475,"output":0.00312,"cacheRead":0.027808,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0758755}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774146691915}}
