feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-ling-feishu-ling-direct-ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774065725916,"sessionId":"cef80983-8de9-495b-9aae-54f7ab3b18f1","model":"Pro/zai-org/GLM-5","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":40210,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/ling/sessions/cef80983-8de9-495b-9aae-54f7ab3b18f1.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"发送仍然超时。我应该让用户确认是否收到了结果，或者尝试其他方式传达结果。我可以直接在当前会话回复用户。"},{"type":"text","text":" 已完成10个 skills 信息查询，发送到 weiwei 会话超时。以下是结果：\n\n---\n\n## 10个 ClawHub Skills 简介（小红书封面用）\n\n| # | Skill | 一句话描述 |\n|---|-------|-----------|\n| 1 | **self-improving-agent** | 持续学习进化：自动记录错误和教训，让AI越用越聪明 |\n| 2 | **find-skills** | 技能发现器：帮你搜索和安装适合的AI技能包 |\n| 3 | **summarize** | 智能摘要器：快速总结网页、PDF、YouTube视频内容 |\n| 4 | **agent-browser** | 浏览器自动化：让AI操控浏览器，点击、填表、截图全搞定 |\n| 5 | **skill-vetter** | 技能安检员：安装前扫描代码，识别安全风险 |\n| 6 | **gog** | Google套件工具：一键操作Gmail、日历、Drive、联系人 |\n| 7 | **github** | GitHub增强：用gh CLI管理PR、Issues、工作流状态 |\n| 8 | **ontology** | 知识图谱引擎：用实体和关系管理复杂项目的知识网络 |\n| 9 | **proactive-agent** | 主动型AI：不等指令就干活，自动记忆、自我进化 |\n| 10 | **weather** | 天气查询：免费无API，一行命令获取全球天气 |\n\n---\n\n**小红书封面建议：**\n- 主标题：「10个让AI开挂的ClawHub技能」\n- 可用图标+名称+4字标签呈现每项"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/zai-org/GLM-5","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774065713324}]},{"key":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-aoao-feishu-aoao-direct-ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1773995962477,"sessionId":"7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48","model":"gpt-5.4","contextTokens":272000,"totalTokens":12765,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw