u-1SNOcePYz07yZ0FpRJJlysNCZ0FcmS41QGnMOaTG8dRnIPwqpV9m3EXWIQqqv5Cj4WukJ89HHdcGW6X1ciNGSQ7dMSl49F-Wcf2MewQ5DFvzfLHKPYQ5wtxHb4clBP_LfcHPa40sBT76Z-93ciwsJS0Qpj2EUbXgXoXRp1OGtg8eiIBd23K2YgtBqsn4O8MDZTt50nDJMdzoIMU3wCBoGfhLTXRepeIHlfAACn2JE5mKVcucinEn3xq0epAfjIOV4Z-GA0jo6FX8vS1tnzLZxK6Oy_3iYSeJcyt1UyoqEO72Pg1vr6O9_1wGZzNJ1p4e-shxU8SlqWKKKuVAD9gb7oF3cu4QwA0MY4Di5nVc3TmSjSkch8P0yrSx2ytpWvX7n3dduhb5KAn_wngKZBIM7IF-M=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating task issues**\\n\\nI see that the task ran but got stuck due to a 403 error from instreet.ai/lander. It seems like the prompt might be too rigid and isn't delivering outputs as expected. I’m thinking I could propose a fix and ask for permission. Maybe I can patch the cron message to bypass InStreet and set up a fallback for when it's inaccessible. Since the user mentioned not receiving it, it seems reasonable to adjust the job prompt to ensure it can degrade gracefully. I’ll edit the jobs.json prompt.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"根因抓到了：**不是投递坏了，是晨报执行流程被 InStreet 网站卡住了。**\n\n具体是：\n- cron 会话 `agent:main:cron:morning-briefing` 已经启动\n- 但它在抓 `https://instreet.ai/lander` 时拿到 **403 Forbidden**\n- 于是它一直在那儿折腾搜索和解析，**没收敛成最终晨报，所以不会投递给你**\n\n这说明当前晨报 prompt 有个设计缺陷：  \n**把 InStreet 当成必做项了，没有“抓不到就降级继续发晨报”的兜底。**\n\n我现在直接把晨报任务热修一下：\n- InStreet 能抓到 → 就带上\n- 抓不到 / 403 → 直接跳过，照样把天气 / 日历 / 待办晨报发出来  \n这样明天不会再因为一个站点 403 整体卡死。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf549ec9d881918c20e7b0685609ee\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_XzE8L3ll5rgZcZBvVW8uijQK|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf549fc8988191add8ffbf85a2dd39","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\npath='/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json'\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    data=json.load(f)\nfor job in data.get('jobs',[]):\n    if job.get('id')=='morning-briefing':\n        job['payload']['message']=(\n            '执行 briefing 技能获取天气、日历与待办，整合成一份简洁、可执行、适合手机阅读的晨报，并直接发送给主人。'\n            '如能获取 InStreet 社区的热门讨论，则追加 1 个“社区观察”小节；'\n            '如 InStreet 无法访问、返回 403、需要登录、解析失败或超时，必须直接跳过该部分，绝不能因此阻塞整份晨报。'\n            '严格结论先行，少废话，不要编造信息。'\n        )\nwith open(path,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    json.dump(data,f,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\n    f.write('\\n')\nprint('updated')\nPY","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json\\npath='/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json'\\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    data=json.load(f)\\nfor job in data.get('jobs',[]):\\n    if job.get('id')=='morning-briefing':\\n        job['payload']['message']=(\\n            '执行 briefing 技能获取天气、日历与待办，整合成一份简洁、可执行、适合手机阅读的晨报，并直接发送给主人。'\\n            '如能获取 InStreet 社区的热门讨论，则追加 1 个“社区观察”小节；'\\n            '如 InStreet 无法访问、返回 403、需要登录、解析失败或超时，必须直接跳过该部分，绝不能因此阻塞整份晨报。'\\n            '严格结论先行，少废话，不要编造信息。'\\n        )\\nwith open(path,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    json.dump(data,f,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\\n    f.write('\\\\n')\\nprint('updated')\\nPY\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":110219,"output":635,"cacheRead":17920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":128774,"cost":{"input":0.2755475,"output":0.009525,"cacheRead":0.00448,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.2895525}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774146710417}}
