unmrAyD9aTqe\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering task updates**\\n\\nIt seems I need to focus on updating cron jobs and maybe adding idle tasks along with a morning merge. I could set an isolated cron job to run every two hours, but without true idle scheduling, I might use low-frequency background tasks as a workaround. I should also read existing jobs and modify the morning message to include learnings. Fetching the xiaping skill might not be necessary now, and I’ll weigh my options on creating this background task.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering user requests**\\n\\nThe user wants me to check community discussions and learn from other AI summaries, but without an API key, I might struggle to access those discussions on the InStreet platform. I could create a task that visits the skill documentation and related public content; if I can’t access hot posts, I’ll record that. Since the user requested a daily report on learning, I’ll set up a cron task to create a note and modify the morning briefing to summarize it. I’ll also consider an isolated task every two hours from 9 to 21.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning file tool usage**\\n\\nAlright, the agent in an isolated session can utilize file tools. I need to come up with a prompt for that. It seems I may need to restart the gateway after changing jobs, but maybe it’s not necessary if I edit via the CLI—it might actually be better! Using cron to add morning tasks could work, but I should consider removing existing ones first. Directly editing jobs.json and then restarting might be the easiest approach since everything is fine for now.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我先说结论：\n\n1. **可以做**\n2. 但“空闲时自动”在 OpenClaw 里没有真正的 idle hook，最稳的是做成**低频后台任务**\n3. **看社区热门讨论**这件事，如果没有 InStreet 的可用账号/API key，很多真实社区内容未必抓得到；我可以先做成：\n   - 能公开抓到的就抓\n   - 抓不到就学习公开文档、相关 skill、其它公开经验\n   - 每天晨报里汇报「学到了什么 / 看到了什么 / 有哪些值得吸收」\n\n我直接给你落地成这两个任务：\n- **后台学习任务**：低打扰、周期运行、只记笔记不打扰你\n- **晨报任务增强**：每天把前一天沉淀的学习内容并入晨报\n\n我现在就改。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf551557108191a867a95b49aed220\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4sfQ4hoU6oI6HwiG9DrO2ACR|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf5516654481918e490d39ed1b0d49","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json, time, os\npath='/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json'\nnow=int(time.time()*1000)\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    data=json.load(f)\njobs=data.get('jobs',[])\n\n# update morning briefing\nfor job in jobs:\n    if job.get('id')=='morning-briefing':\n        job['updatedAtMs']=now\n        job['payload']['message']=(\n            '执行 briefing 技能获取天气、日历与待办，整合成一份简洁、可执行、适合手机阅读的晨报，并直接发送给主人。'\n            '同时读取 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md 中最近沉淀的学习记录，增加一个“AI 学习 / 社区观察”小节，汇报：昨天到今天你学会了什么、看到了什么、哪些值得吸收。'\n            '如果 InStreet 社区或相关页面可以公开访问，则提炼热门讨论和高质量经验；如果无法访问、返回 403、需要登录、解析失败或超时，必须直接跳过该部分，改为汇报公开可得的技能/经验学习，不得因此阻塞整份晨报。'\n            '严格结论先行，少废话，不要编造信息。'\n        )\n\n# upsert idle learning job\nnew_job={\n    'id':'instreet-idle-learning',\n    'name':'InStreet/Skills 空闲学习沉淀',\n    'enabled':True,\n    'createdAtMs':now,\n    'updatedAtMs':now,\n    'schedule':{\n        'kind':'cron',\n        'expr':'17 9-21/2 * * *',\n        'tz':'Asia/Shanghai'\n    },\n    'sessionTarget':'isolated',\n    'wakeMode':'now',\n    'payload':{\n        'kind':'agentTurn',\n        'message':(\n            '这是一个低优先级后台学习任务。访问并学习以下公开资料：'\n            'https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md ，必要时再看其中引用的相关公开 skill 文档（如 groups-skill、literary-skill、arena-skill、oracle-skill、game-skill、xiaping skill 等）。'\n            '目标：1) 提炼 InStreet 社区/Agent 生态里值得关注的热门话题或趋势；2) 学习其他 AI/Agent 总结的高质量经验，取其精华、弃其糟粕；3) 如果看到对当前助理工作真正有帮助的公开 skills 或工作流，记录可借鉴点。'\n            '把结果追加写入 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md ，格式固定为按日期追加的 Markdown 小节，包含：发现、可吸收经验、明确舍弃点、可用于晨报的 3-5 条 bullet。'\n            '如果抓不到真实社区热门讨论，就明确写“本轮未获取到社区热帖，仅学习公开文档/经验”，禁止编造。'\n            '这是后台任务，不要给用户主动发消息；仅写入学习笔记文件。'\n        )\n    },\n    'delivery':{'mode':'none'},\n    'state':{}\n}\nfound=False\nfor i,j in enumerate(jobs):\n    if j.get('id')=='instreet-idle-learning':\n        new_job['createdAtMs']=j.get('createdAtMs',now)\n        jobs[i]=new_job\n        found=True\n        break\nif not found:\n    jobs.append(new_job)\n\ndata['jobs']=jobs\nwith open(path,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    json.dump(data,f,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\n    f.write('\\n')\n\n# ensure note file exists\nnote='/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md'\nos.makedirs(os.path.dirname(note), exist_ok=True)\nif not os.path.exists(note):\n    with open(note,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write('# InStreet / Skills 学习沉淀\\n\\n')\nprint('updated jobs and note')\nPY","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json, time, os\\npath='/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json'\\nnow=int(time.time()*1000)\\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    data=json.load(f)\\njobs=data.get('jobs',[])\\n\\n# update morning briefing\\nfor job in jobs:\\n    if job.get('id')=='morning-briefing':\\n        job['updatedAtMs']=now\\n        job['payload']['message']=(\\n            '执行 briefing 技能获取天气、日历与待办，整合成一份简洁、可执行、适合手机阅读的晨报，并直接发送给主人。'\\n            '同时读取 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md 中最近沉淀的学习记录，增加一个“AI 学习 / 社区观察”小节，汇报：昨天到今天你学会了什么、看到了什么、哪些值得吸收。'\\n            '如果 InStreet 社区或相关页面可以公开访问，则提炼热门讨论和高质量经验；如果无法访问、返回 403、需要登录、解析失败或超时，必须直接跳过该部分，改为汇报公开可得的技能/经验学习，不得因此阻塞整份晨报。'\\n            '严格结论先行，少废话，不要编造信息。'\\n        )\\n\\n# upsert idle learning job\\nnew_job={\\n    'id':'instreet-idle-learning',\\n    'name':'InStreet/Skills 空闲学习沉淀',\\n    'enabled':True,\\n    'createdAtMs':now,\\n    'updatedAtMs':now,\\n    'schedule':{\\n        'kind':'cron',\\n        'expr':'17 9-21/2 * * *',\\n        'tz':'Asia/Shanghai'\\n    },\\n    'sessionTarget':'isolated',\\n    'wakeMode':'now',\\n    'payload':{\\n        'kind':'agentTurn',\\n        'message':(\\n            '这是一个低优先级后台学习任务。访问并学习以下公开资料：'\\n            'https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md ，必要时再看其中引用的相关公开 skill 文档（如 groups-skill、literary-skill、arena-skill、oracle-skill、game-skill、xiaping skill 等）。'\\n            '目标：1) 提炼 InStreet 社区/Agent 生态里值得关注的热门话题或趋势；2) 学习其他 AI/Agent 总结的高质量经验，取其精华、弃其糟粕；3) 如果看到对当前助理工作真正有帮助的公开 skills 或工作流，记录可借鉴点。'\\n            '把结果追加写入 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md ，格式固定为按日期追加的 Markdown 小节，包含：发现、可吸收经验、明确舍弃点、可用于晨报的 3-5 条 bullet。'\\n            '如果抓不到真实社区热门讨论，就明确写“本轮未获取到社区热帖，仅学习公开文档/经验”，禁止编造。'\\n            '这是后台任务，不要给用户主动发消息；仅写入学习笔记文件。'\\n        )\\n    },\\n    'delivery':{'mode':'none'},\\n    'state':{}\\n}\\nfound=False\\nfor i,j in enumerate(jobs):\\n    if j.get('id')=='instreet-idle-learning':\\n        new_job['createdAtMs']=j.get('createdAtMs',now)\\n        jobs[i]=new_job\\n        found=True\\n        break\\nif not found:\\n    jobs.append(new_job)\\n\\ndata['jobs']=jobs\\nwith open(path,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    json.dump(data,f,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\\n    f.write('\\\\n')\\n\\n# ensure note file exists\\nnote='/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md'\\nos.makedirs(os.path.dirname(note), exist_ok=True)\\nif not os.path.exists(note):\\n    with open(note,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n        f.write('# InStreet / Skills 学习沉淀\\\\n\\\\n')\\nprint('updated jobs and note')\\nPY\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":6275,"output":1734,"cacheRead":146688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":154697,"cost":{"input":0.0156875,"output":0.026010000000000002,"cacheRead":0.036671999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0783695}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774146821648}}
