n\\nIt looks like the user is inquiring about memory retrieval for configurations. Maybe I need to modify some tasks for better clarity. I wonder if I should mention that providing a broader task summary may not be possible unless all tasks are recorded. However, I could set up a daily note for a morning report and think about integrating street-learning or a to-do list. It seems like I need to take some action!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我直接按这套来改：\n\n- **5:00 学习**\n- **8:00 晨报**\n- **晨报汇总前一天所有任务 + 总结**\n\n我会把晨报 prompt 一并改掉，让它优先读前一天的日记/学习沉淀来汇总。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf5700d14081918e60790034069d35\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_RYwfAo3zUbHMRDw11q8oUD19|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bf5700f36881919bf03a975b486dd3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json, time\npath='/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json'\nnow=int(time.time()*1000)\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    data=json.load(f)\nfor job in data.get('jobs',[]):\n    if job.get('id')=='instreet-idle-learning':\n        job['name']='InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习'\n        job['updatedAtMs']=now\n        job['schedule']={'kind':'cron','expr':'0 5 * * *','tz':'Asia/Shanghai'}\n    if job.get('id')=='morning-briefing':\n        job['name']='每日 8 点晨报'\n        job['updatedAtMs']=now\n        job['schedule']={'kind':'cron','expr':'0 8 * * *','tz':'Asia/Shanghai'}\n        job['payload']['message']=(\n            '生成今天早上 8 点的晨报并直接发送给主人。'\n            '晨报必须汇总前一天的所有已记录任务与结果，优先读取 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/ 下前一天对应的 YYYY-MM-DD.md 日记，以及 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md 学习沉淀。'\n            '如果能从这些记录里提炼出：昨天做了什么、完成了什么、卡在哪里、今天值得关注什么，就按这个结构输出。'\n            '同时补充 briefing 技能可获得的天气、日历、待办信息。'\n            '如果 InStreet 或相关公开页面可访问，则加入“AI 学习 / 社区观察”小节；若抓不到、403、需登录、解析失败或超时，就直接基于本地学习沉淀汇报，不得阻塞晨报。'\n            '输出要求：1) 先给总览摘要；2) 再给前一天任务汇总；3) 再给今天日程/天气/待办；4) 最后给一段简短总结。'\n            '严格结论先行，简洁，少废话，不要编造。'\n        )\nwith open(path,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    json.dump(data,f,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\n    f.write('\\n')\nprint('updated')\nPY","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json, time\\npath='/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json'\\nnow=int(time.time()*1000)\\nwith open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    data=json.load(f)\\nfor job in data.get('jobs',[]):\\n    if job.get('id')=='instreet-idle-learning':\\n        job['name']='InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习'\\n        job['updatedAtMs']=now\\n        job['schedule']={'kind':'cron','expr':'0 5 * * *','tz':'Asia/Shanghai'}\\n    if job.get('id')=='morning-briefing':\\n        job['name']='每日 8 点晨报'\\n        job['updatedAtMs']=now\\n        job['schedule']={'kind':'cron','expr':'0 8 * * *','tz':'Asia/Shanghai'}\\n        job['payload']['message']=(\\n            '生成今天早上 8 点的晨报并直接发送给主人。'\\n            '晨报必须汇总前一天的所有已记录任务与结果，优先读取 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/ 下前一天对应的 YYYY-MM-DD.md 日记，以及 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md 学习沉淀。'\\n            '如果能从这些记录里提炼出：昨天做了什么、完成了什么、卡在哪里、今天值得关注什么，就按这个结构输出。'\\n            '同时补充 briefing 技能可获得的天气、日历、待办信息。'\\n            '如果 InStreet 或相关公开页面可访问，则加入“AI 学习 / 社区观察”小节；若抓不到、403、需登录、解析失败或超时，就直接基于本地学习沉淀汇报，不得阻塞晨报。'\\n            '输出要求：1) 先给总览摘要；2) 再给前一天任务汇总；3) 再给今天日程/天气/待办；4) 最后给一段简短总结。'\\n            '严格结论先行，简洁，少废话，不要编造。'\\n        )\\nwith open(path,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    json.dump(data,f,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\\n    f.write('\\\\n')\\nprint('updated')\\nPY\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":20}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1182,"output":707,"cacheRead":155520,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":157409,"cost":{"input":0.002955,"output":0.010605,"cacheRead":0.03888,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.05244}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774147324032}}
