{"type":"message","id":"c1116d36","parentId":"b2ca9754","timestamp":"2026-03-22T11:22:12.790Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Ewfy4I9Q5lO9DUsFTjBk3MGv|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bfd0dd5bb08191b1af95d22028aad6","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/cli/cron.md:28:Note: retention/pruning is controlled in config:\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/cli/cron.md:30:- `cron.sessionRetention` (default `24h`) prunes completed isolated run sessions.\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:186:openclaw cron add --name \"Weekly review\" --cron \"0 9 * * 1\" --session isolated --message \"...\" --model opus\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/channels/whatsapp.md:380:- `agents.defaults.heartbeat.model`（可选覆盖）\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/prompt-caching.md:5:  - You want to reduce prompt token costs with cache retention\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/prompt-caching.md:25:Set cache retention on model params:\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/session-management-compaction.md:76:- `resetArchiveRetention`: retention for `*.reset.<timestamp>` transcript archives (default: same as `pruneAfter`; `false` disables cleanup)\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/session-management-compaction.md:99:Isolated cron runs also create session entries/transcripts, and they have dedicated retention controls:\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/session-management-compaction.md:101:- `cron.sessionRetention` (default `24h`) prunes old isolated cron run sessions from the session store (`false` disables).\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:153:  YES -> Use cron (isolated) with --model/--thinking\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:184:openclaw cron add --name \"Weekly review\" --cron \"0 9 * * 1\" --session isolated --message \"...\" --model opus\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-vs-heartbeat.md:280:- Use isolated cron with a cheaper model for routine tasks.\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-jobs.md:365:- Isolated cron run sessions in `sessions.json` are pruned by `cron.sessionRetention` (default `24h`; set `false` to disable).\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-jobs.md:417:    sessionRetention: \"24h\", // duration string or false\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-jobs.md:448:Cron has two built-in maintenance paths: isolated run-session retention and run-log pruning.\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-jobs.md:452:- `cron.sessionRetention`: `24h` (set `false` to disable run-session pruning)\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-jobs.md:459:- The reaper removes expired run-session entries older than `cron.sessionRetention`.\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-jobs.md:460:- For removed run sessions no longer referenced by the session store, OpenClaw archives transcript files and purges old deleted archives on the same retention window.\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-jobs.md:470:- long `cron.sessionRetention` windows with many isolated runs\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-jobs.md:476:- keep `cron.sessionRetention` as short as your debugging/audit needs allow\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/automation/cron-jobs.md:479:- review growth periodically with `openclaw cron runs` and adjust retention before logs become large\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnp