e for heartbeat runs (`provider/model`).\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/heartbeat.md:283:If **all three** are false, OpenClaw skips the heartbeat run entirely (no model call).\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/heartbeat.md:323:If the file is missing, the heartbeat still runs and the model decides what to do.\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-examples.md:361:    sessionRetention: \"24h\",\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:855:### 0.8) Logs + transcripts (redaction + retention)\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:867:- Prune old session transcripts and log files if you don’t need long retention.\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/start/openclaw.md:165:- If the file is missing, the heartbeat still runs and the model decides what to do.\n/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/platforms/mac/peekaboo.md:57:If you need longer retention, re‑capture from the client.","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774178532768}}
