{"type":"message","id":"38f6c067","parentId":"c2ba3d21","timestamp":"2026-03-22T11:22:33.242Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Inspecting configuration details**\n\nI wonder if I should remove any exposed secrets, even though the user didn’t specifically ask for that. It’s probably not great to echo sensitive information, but it might be too late since the tool output is already available. I’ll need to focus on avoiding any mentions of secrets moving forward. Additionally, it seems important to inspect the rest of the configuration for the cron block, especially around offset 261.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bfd0f5c1608191a8e7b132f91adbf3\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpv9D4GHwYyodp8pvUd2Hu03WxEgvudf-ammEwstOeWzSTEqhzlA42caqmnW2EWgzsGNZZdDHnH4N6XgdUM7BsfSfeFwjLcvl_YMPNRkIX_XhXIuqgC5eJpYrdXIzQAknQ73VKIDyKuPnI-akttxv6IyTMuDAE9Hbk7AXXndDCwsj8FGajBUBXh1NzMCtdu6BZeyZ4nWTh_HVlLwoyWRHvw6_cT8729XMN_OyzEY62ShdEBopIHLFAG9APo4neySQz9OLpT3-RUTjlbD0SyI0QqYZ6JqtWTzk78O98v9KHx27i0r_FAgb447hvoNMNyliNCJxkLtNY8F_So6BDUhqYkwoD7k90tzsDH3gXZMJv4XFnhv_jwJC7GDjVCfhk3xiZGSWDMmCwu0k_2cNLMjl7aBL9CnDu284i-Mnx0pctK9cwtIBjR4tvaOMhH9Q5bvtgJl8Y0ZaQee71Hexu5WCE--atHfOZjLgZzHKmtR8NqMzKFrkeMii7x3P1MTgeyFpkL0PJXInucsRKK12eJSVeyXB1MiFwW0dOUuRi_2cZhGMpyny3IbJ2-ZDoILR-rliI7Ue8Ir7B55Q1dbaqp_DU3AEkvcHrOFiKZQm60MJaNt1hKjl-ZcyxM_LmCFGo7Sk6Ys_kMbtBSNTuGakAilS52idS5NtugDZciiRfFisSwNsAnns-tKgUykS6y3HjSxz8fhwhLM91XweDH7f6jN8kmrsPQf34P-8DODOuRTnIyqDhyKh_xCDACwas_il60jX8HyPthiGwDCT22P8XlA8Pw7t2pLBoLmOYXawbj5qiXEHL-dfah6tydu0vuwaYqJ9e_lkzE-R3QrkDshTkCBKG2SWPT32upAyOhObLbzFzR4xaidLvU8fumlh9sYDbqTmFGEiTBBZ633deDJMpxSVKR3hXAuj-JyjkwJhvUTDaCgdgQ_kwbkyt4Es2MBo6u4cxmGFc1Ld-l_r5VFv7E1J9pgwQDIWWHgiiCmcjYuy7UJ1pDz4MUZHuYld9s9ibja9neO4VW-JNFgAfHJX3_3i9yMCI8KBzimqPvovQoB2hJKQzaYU=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Inspecting configuration details**\\n\\nI wonder if I should remove any exposed secrets, even thoug