YrkD58XzTsrT0yngcwtqYf44jgMl9oyuxo8fnxP08FA7Anify3m-Kvt7ZBXIkhiBvwfaQQJQWnk3VJ_F3sqvgHlZLuMROp5i9dtsoSacPhFhrFZM22U_osYXioDTql5xKHRBfUljhwxdmUiskfc8ae5coBMiffwn752QhJ0LNflg-3szk-YrXwBUhIXYK8t0TZ0YXEjegoFSP4Oyx5pOCsBDzNMASJPyoYLq5ibpQNuneCSbj0E4qNOxhKKbnArOXeDzU2_QnrxoT0h6AU5KO9Y4ANVTZDjJNor92beVTm6rhRnIWLej1h2ujKpwSroN3S_VS7gXm8OETizmHzy690Z267YZFaX1TNjGsy9fxspXHICUn-2tPp-gohwUkRIYdRczGsHJ3FPP1zhyTKk3F7eJwZSWmhEVeUh5OYHG0zK2p3CCu_l2Ivty1Jg3JhCg3k56MpGzGq7bp7yR-o-c1KIcTcLu9Z649ihb5uyGKmn0EgG7cmVPcjfMnnUenEY5zQTW_agiyqBADEB0DEgBn8_MvggDqTh_2Qp32eKOxJLJcGwx1553t_l_BpsoZBaykojNJ8OEgfFk_17UXpt219XkU9bprgadAwC9hTTxQHejTsDY2lF4j9l0ByWeLpaC8kIgrDxJorwngpDh3x7-d30gnsdR723jIFR3gZIzcPQRx05GYRH0601j2eZsd_FolzSd3sC8RsyCwurusytLfzhRghb8q0-hStYwasER5O7tYLtdcnsT5We9P_OvNWIoxdxC7IXSqr-0lWF0YOq40fMrZZZRiQLxHi4G3Hgm_wLZGgEbaVh82kqxS8MNLuTXEq4cpKCP2M92M5Guqw68LHXsIIe6IVD8Mjocrr1S_Rudi-qQ-cPjieigzoj4MPlX9xzTrDYZ_owvKkl-LB1h2LDgISnnVIhmxBgEu5N_PXlrc3p7dQeatklJcX1pgmoTmVVkvIW3KM-zfXYvCA1Q3ROn8iWHre-HDvpAaveobXudbzeBf5eK6CqiGc0MqmHMG7QjxAurMVI2fT3AVD9QrqqpBj7Td41t7brdKket-D49sKWweGDaf0qeq2t25QW32QhvVGOMFbSXVBawblvUxi8eThMRKk0hLTnXDUVdke7sMykVhy7vDCUAbNoIs0W4nao2pOmLJMQM09ni14RjNMd-NCrgxKwbln95yZpN6NGCa22XIQksIsBRDPm9U=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering session management risks**\\n\\nI'm thinking about how it's easier to delete entire old session files for agents that used siliconflow. The user asked about an error, and I wonder if it's acceptable to prune old completed sessions. I could target only the session files with siliconflow references, but that feels risky. I might need to inspect the sessions.json structure to see if I can remove entries based on the transcript path. However, I could lose useful history. Maybe setting a policy to ignore certain entries is better than erasing everything.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我不做半截方案，直接按“能清就清、能默认就默认”处理：\n\n- **删备份**\n- **把现有 3 个 cron 任务默认模型都锁到 `arkcode/deepseek-v3.2`**\n- **把 cron 会话保留期压到 12h**，旧 cron 痕迹会更快自动清掉\n- **把历史 session 里含 siliconflow 的旧痕迹做一次清理**：只清理旧转录里的 `provider/model-snapshot error` 相关痕迹，不碰当前有效配置\n\n现在动手。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bfd10978ac819191e73a132bc93213\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_MnmDkZTcvMsoieQHwwd9Z6IY|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bfd109eb448191a27a0bb80406dfbb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json, glob, os, shutil, time\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n# 1) delete the just-created siliconflow backup files\nfor p in glob.glob('/root/.openclaw/**/*.pre-remove-siliconflow-*.bak', recursive=True):\n    try: os.remove(p)\n    except FileNotFoundError: pass\nfor p in glob.glob('/root/.openclaw/**/*.final-remove-siliconflow-*.bak', recursive=True):\n    try: os.remove(p)\n    except FileNotFoundError: pass\n\n# 2) set heartbeat + cron defaults in config\ncfg = Path('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json')\ndata = json.loads(cfg.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\n\ndef ensure(d, k, default):\n    if k not in d or not isinstance(d[k], type(default)):\n        d[k] = default\n    return d[k]\n\nagents = ensure(data, 'agents', {})\ndefaults = ensure(agents, 'defaults', {})\nheartbeat = ensure(defaults, 'heartbeat', {})\nheartbeat['model'] = 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2'\ncron = ensure(data, 'cron', {})\ncron['sessionRetention'] = '12h'\ncron['model'] = 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2'\ncfg.write_text(json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + '\\n', encoding='utf-8')\n\n# 3) set model on existing cron jobs explicitly\njobs_path = Path('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json')\njobs = json.loads(jobs_path.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\nfor job in jobs.get('jobs', []):\n    job['model'] = 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2'\njobs_path.write_text(json.dumps(jobs, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + '\\n', encoding='utf-8')\n\n# 4) clean old session transcript traces mentioning siliconflow\n#    conservative strategy: archive matching jsonl transcripts to .deleted and remove sessions.json entries pointing to them\nsession_store = Path('/root/.openclaw/agents')\nremoved = []\nfor sessions_json in session_store.glob('*/sessions/sessions.json'):\n    try:\n        store = json.loads(sessions_json.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\n    except Exception:\n        continue\n    changed = False\n    if isinstance(store, dict):\n        for key in list(store.keys()):\n            ent = store.get(key)\n            if not isinstance(ent, dict):\n                continue\n            tp = ent.get('transcriptPath')\n            if not tp or not os.path.exists(tp):\n                continue\n            try:\n                text = Path(tp).read_text(encoding='utf-8', errors='ignore')\n            except Exception:\n                continue\n            if 'provider\":\"siliconflow\"' in text or 'provider\":\"siliconflow\"'.replace('\\\\','') in text or 'provider\":\"siliconflow\"' in text or 'provider\":\"siliconflow\"' in text or 'provider\":\"siliconflow\"' in text:\n                deleted = tp + f'.deleted.{int(time.time())}'\n                shutil.move(tp, deleted)\n                store.pop(key, None)\n                removed.append((str(sessions_json), tp, deleted))\n                changed = True\n    if changed:\n        sessions_json.write_text(json.dumps(store, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + '\\n', encoding='utf-8')\n\nprint(json.dumps({'removedSessions': removed, 'cronModel':'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2', 'heartbeatModel':'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2'}, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\nPY\nopenclaw gateway restart\nsleep 2\nprintf '\\n--- verify config ---\\n'\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\ncfg=json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json','r',encoding='utf-8'))\nprint('heartbeat', cfg.get('agents',{}).get('defaults',{}).get('heartbeat',{}).get('model'))\nprint('cron', cfg.get('cron',{}))\njobs=json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json','r',encoding='utf-8'))\nfor j in jobs.get('jobs',[]):\n    print(j['id'], j.get('model'))\nPY\nprintf '\\n--- verify siliconflow refs in live config ---\\n'\ngrep -RIn --exclude='*.bak' --exclude='*.jsonl' --exclude='sessions.json' '\"siliconflow\"\\|siliconflow/' /root/.openclaw/openclaw.json /root/.openclaw/agents/*/agent/models.json /root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json 2>/dev/null || true","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":1000,"timeout":180},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json, glob, os, shutil, time\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\n# 1) delete the just-created siliconflow backup files\\nfor p in glob.glob('/root/.openclaw/**/*.pre-remove-siliconflow-*.bak', recursive=True):\\n    try: os.remove(p)\\n    except FileNotFoundError: pass\\nfor p in glob.glob('/root/.openclaw/**/*.final-remove-siliconflow-*.bak', recursive=True):\\n    try: os.remove(p)\\n    except FileNotFoundError: pass\\n\\n# 2) set heartbeat + cron defaults in config\\ncfg = Path('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json')\\ndata = json.loads(cfg.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\\n\\ndef ensure(d, k, default):\\n    if k not in d or not isinstance(d[k], type(default)):\\n        d[k] = default\\n    return d[k]\\n\\nagents = ensure(data, 'agents', {})\\ndefaults = ensure(agents, 'defaults', {})\\nheartbeat = ensure(defaults, 'heartbeat', {})\\nheartbeat['model'] = 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2'\\ncron = ensure(data, 'cron', {})\\ncron['sessionRetention'] = '12h'\\ncron['model'] = 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2'\\ncfg.write_text(json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + '\\\\n', encoding='utf-8')\\n\\n# 3) set model on existing cron jobs explicitly\\njobs_path = Path('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json')\\njobs = json.loads(jobs_path.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\\nfor job in jobs.get('jobs', []):\\n    job['model'] = 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2'\\njobs_path.write_text(json.dumps(jobs, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + '\\\\n', encoding='utf-8')\\n\\n# 4) clean old session transcript traces mentioning siliconflow\\n#    conservative strategy: archive matching jsonl transcripts to .deleted and remove sessions.json entries pointing to them\\nsession_store = Path('/root/.openclaw/agents')\\nremoved = []\\nfor sessions_json in session_store.glob('*/sessions/sessions.json'):\\n    try:\\n        store = json.loads(sessions_json.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\\n    except Exception:\\n        continue\\n    changed = False\\n    if isinstance(store, dict):\\n        for key in list(store.keys()):\\n            ent = store.get(key)\\n            if not isinstance(ent, dict):\\n                continue\\n            tp = ent.get('transcriptPath')\\n            if not tp or not os.path.exists(tp):\\n                continue\\n            try:\\n                text = Path(tp).read_text(encoding='utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n            except Exception:\\n                continue\\n            if 'provider\\\":\\\"siliconflow\\\"' in text or 'provider\\\":\\\"siliconflow\\\"'.replace('\\\\\\\\','') in text or 'provider\\\":\\\"siliconflow\\\"' in text or 'provider\\\":\\\"siliconflow\\\"' in text or 'provider\\\":\\\"siliconflow\\\"' in text:\\n                deleted = tp + f'.deleted.{int(time.time())}'\\n                shutil.move(tp, deleted)\\n                store.pop(key, None)\\n                removed.append((str(sessions_json), tp, deleted))\\n                changed = True\\n    if changed:\\n        sessions_json.write_text(json.dumps(store, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + '\\\\n', encoding='utf-8')\\n\\nprint(json.dumps({'removedSessions': removed, 'cronModel':'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2', 'heartbeatModel':'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2'}, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\\nPY\\nopenclaw gateway restart\\nsleep 2\\nprintf '\\\\n--- verify config ---\\\\n'\\npython3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json\\ncfg=json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json','r',encoding='utf-8'))\\nprint('heartbeat', cfg.get('agents',{}).get('defaults',{}).get('heartbeat',{}).get('model'))\\nprint('cron', cfg.get('cron',{}))\\njobs=json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json','r',encoding='utf-8'))\\nfor j in jobs.get('jobs',[]):\\n    print(j['id'], j.get('model'))\\nPY\\nprintf '\\\\n--- verify siliconflow refs in live config ---\\\\n'\\ngrep -RIn --exclude='*.bak' --exclude='*.jsonl' --exclude='sessions.json' '\\\"siliconflow\\\"\\\\|siliconflow/' /root/.openclaw/openclaw.json /root/.openclaw/agents/*/agent/models.json /root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json 2>/dev/null || true\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":1000,\"timeout\":180}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":979,"output":1785,"cacheRead":155136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":157900,"cost":{"input":0.0024475,"output":0.026775,"cacheRead":0.038784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0680065}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774178553260}}
