{"type":"message","id":"69a0fb02","parentId":"d7130d53","timestamp":"2026-03-22T11:23:30.236Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Fixing configuration issues**\n\nI need to remove the invalid key and restart the system. It looks like there might not be a default model configuration for the cron jobs. I'll keep models per job instead. Plus, I have to address the cleaned sessions because the search pattern failed due to none existing. It's also essential to delete any backups that have been completed. Overall, I really need to fix the invalid configuration too!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bfd128a3ec819196e2b872ac3f19a2\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpv9Er4Fkw4KS1Gk6xjtlJgmaPMXlV5sU6NnOysOX83NVZ5NKnQxxc7QrqFWRtj1t2XdwTLjx4Z7okIStuFKRFz0BfJp26kC2pJVKIrlH44gdtawLUkMLiJnxhfi02qGobycALmpnQ8CZ11wju8wQTd_MZB3Cub3nOs4V6OnX8ai2NTJ4xMxAJDhq1SCipfvxy2Q6DGd1c-mTWj-GQJ_S1vAoM9ZC36OFQCjeoVXAUEWtbcOmoadxbBABSrJhbWsTUtFj6s1BULBhiWgmNGyZTxXtYeC_fFHKz-Z4oHG6WtCGmdJnlU_U6emvSlqIe1QCVEei2kJwj6H1zYX14-JXbJA8D2_iFmGRYPB0_LeYHQoacbII75igcysWiQa4tjjeEMGM9_oklq0_0L9Mno7YfOiHw_lNkXzRTudL1ubGoNCnmehX8HJcPOFowcQvE36aeWso83XvEdia4dF27Q2IQG-PpiTa-c53ZPwg0xeZJTHv5DaYn3Hh2J2q8VtMrarC1hhJaebQXfs4UJsSVsPxbn36_AToo6jE4dCuMo4x53PEvBdUPRWwyO3FRtcI1dXEiAHeNbfETZ8Lg17dtcmydfDElKL3735ZJ18vdZT0qWvnYUJERZT58gUtuvzS2Llz7ZnhtI4WGiCesllic8Nlc9e5MstKybksYuT354DiIYNJOxEOeT-x2HxmbDSAHCgC6NkSNz0qMA2310McDM01IH8iFnlAex1AjEWrdYIaBPSdO0EVyZKwU5vbizWZb4Qy62JiQkHkxOXstSLpeT_GzjQFWhLO5845DVBoOm0-hQaXm_axLnXLOw-jSUFYTWLU3VFAmshdMqdbykORwFcD9QwK7x7AkHvcBOFoW2U4Yp9Hb1YcQnLYkiLltQ1eFd5Hq6n7yqv21m1x_aLG9FLVgYoNKrv3uwfgnIBnSimNsWRv1Vsa70NDPO_NM5gIXAvpRnYP7ygRuQNNa3O_gjkxpP8MpTbffPBu24bYZCm7226yQGOt4EWxQ3q4XUwGLst5ljdhoGKraB-MPqdSi99TB8ZhXOQscqECk9HgDFjbtufDHbcGXE79aCtbu9Aid4zR7kLP0sz_kF41krW-1kIeVCuvRlI3VAFj6_gxkzgq2VMDTUTo=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Fixing configuration issues**\\n\\nI need to remove the invalid key and restart the system. It looks like there might not be a default model configuration for the cron jobs. I'll keep models per job instead. Plus, I have to address the cleaned sessions because the search pattern failed due to none existing. It's also essential to delete any backups that have been completed. Overall, I really need to fix the invalid configuration too!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我把 heartbeat 和每个 cron 任务的模型都设对了，但有个坑我刚踩到了：\n\n- `heartbeat.model` **有效**\n- `cron.model` **是无效配置键**，会让 Gateway 配置报错\n\n所以正确做法不是全局 `cron.model`，而是：\n- **删除无效的 `cron.model`**\n- **保留每个 cron job 上的 `model: arkcode/deepseek-v3.2`**  \n这已经能实现你要的 cron 默认效果了。\n\n我现在立刻把这个无效键删掉并恢复 Gateway。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bfd12b4ed08191841206a2b22029db\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_GI9Od4KuReSpQSTHZ5eTZ232|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bfd12c1ff08191a76509fa4f24df30","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\np='/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json'\nwith open(p,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    data=json.load(f)\ncron=data.get('cron')\nif isinstance(cron, dict):\n    cron.pop('model', None)\nwith open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    json.dump(data, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n    f.write('\\n')\nprint('removed invalid cron.model')\nPY\nopenclaw gateway restart\nsleep 2\nprintf '\\n--- verify ---\\n'\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\ncfg=json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json','r',encoding='utf-8'))\nprint('heartbeat', cfg.get('agents',{}).get('defaults',{}).get('heartbeat',{}).get('model'))\nprint('cron', cfg.get('cron',{}))\njobs=json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json','r',encoding='utf-8'))\nfor j in jobs.get('jobs',[]):\n    print(j['id'], j.get('model'))\nPY\nopenclaw gateway status","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":1000,"timeout":180},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json\\np='/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json'\\nwith open(p,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    data=json.load(f)\\ncron=data.get('cron')\\nif isinstance(cron, dict):\\n    cron.pop('model', None)\\nwith open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    json.dump(data, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\\n    f.write('\\\\n')\\nprint('removed invalid cron.model')\\nPY\\nopenclaw gateway restart\\nsleep 2\\nprintf '\\\\n--- verify ---\\\\n'\\npython3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json\\ncfg=json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json','r',encoding='utf-8'))\\nprint('heartbeat', cfg.get('agents',{}).get('defaults',{}).get('heartbeat',{}).get('model'))\\nprint('cron', cfg.get('cron',{}))\\njobs=json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json','r',encoding='utf-8'))\\nfor j in jobs.get('jobs',[]):\\n    print(j['id'], j.get('model'))\\nPY\\nopenclaw gateway status\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":1000,\"timeout\":180}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":527,"output":502,"cacheRead":157824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":158853,"cost":{"input":0.0013175,"output":0.00753,"cacheRead":0.039456,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0483035}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774178594985}}
