{"type":"message","id":"bb4a5003","parentId":"c18c335c","timestamp":"2026-03-22T13:30:12.949Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_kKigjxMBqOjpKiY08v2UTDN7|fc_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bfeee12974819186392226a6db068b","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"primary= hgapi/gpt-5.4\nfallbacks= ['openai-codex/gpt-5.4', 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2']\nprovider_exists= True\nprovider= {'baseUrl': 'https://11531817.cc.cd/openai', 'apiKey': 'sk-b79de257f650935b3f593b405f6448067a8b3ac208498d630f162777826b1dd2', 'api': 'openai-completions', 'models': [{'id': 'gpt-5.4', 'name': 'GPT-5.4'}]}\nService: systemd (enabled)\nFile logs: /tmp/openclaw/openclaw-2026-03-22.log\nCommand: /root/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.1/bin/node /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/index.js gateway --port 34459\nService file: ~/.config/systemd/user/openclaw-gateway.service\nService env: OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PORT=34459\n\nService config looks out of date or non-standard.\nService config issue: Gateway service uses Node from a version manager; it can break after upgrades. (/root/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.1/bin/node)\nService config issue: System Node 22+ not found; install it before migrating away from version managers.\nRecommendation: run \"openclaw doctor\" (or \"openclaw doctor --repair\").\nConfig (cli): ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\nConfig (service): ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n\nGateway: bind=lan (0.0.0.0), port=34459 (service args)\nProbe target: ws://127.0.0.1:34459\nDashboard: http://10.3.0.12:34459/afpkti/\nProbe note: bind=lan listens on 0.0.0.0 (all interfaces); probing via 127.0.0.1.\n\nRuntime: running (pid 3035442, state active, sub running, last exit 0, reason 0)\nRPC probe: ok\n\nListening: *:34459\nTroubles: run openclaw status\nTroubleshooting: https://docs.openclaw.ai/troubleshooting"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3465,"aggregated":"primary= hgapi/gpt-5.4\nfallbacks= ['openai-codex/gpt-5.4', 'arkcode/deepseek-v3.2']\nprovider_exists= True\nprovider= {'baseUrl': 'https://11531817.cc.cd/openai', 'apiKey': 'sk-b79de257f650935b3f593b405f6448067a8b3ac208498d630f162777826b1dd2', 'api': 'openai-completions', 'models': [{'id': 'gpt-5.4', 'name': 'GPT-5.4'}]}\nService: systemd (enabled)\nFile logs: /tmp/openclaw/openclaw-2026-03-22.log\nCommand: /root/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.1/bin/node /root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/dist/index.js gateway --port 34459\nService file: ~/.config/systemd/user/openclaw-gateway.service\nService env: OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PORT=34459\n\nService config looks out of date or non-standard.\nService config issue: Gateway service uses Node from a version manager; it can break after upgrades. (/root/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.1/bin/node)\nService config issue: System Node 22+ not found; install it before migrating away from version managers.\nRecommendation: run \"openclaw doctor\" (or \"openclaw doctor --repair\").\nConfig (cli): ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\nConfig (service): ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n\nGateway: bind=lan (0.0.0.0), port=34459 (service args)\nProbe target: ws://127.0.0.1:34459\nDashboard: http://10.3.0.12:34459/afpkti/\nProbe note: bind=lan listens on 0.0.0.0 (all interfaces); probing via 127.0.0.1.\n\nRuntime: running (pid 3035442, state active, sub running, last exit 0, reason 0)\nRPC probe: ok\n\nListening: *:34459\nTroubles: run openclaw status\nTroubleshooting: https://docs.openclaw.ai/troubleshooting","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774186212928}}
{"type":"message","id":"79dd9da8","parentId":"bb4a5003","timestamp":"2026-03-22T13:30:21.021Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好了，已经接进去了，而且已经切成主模型。\n\n### 当前配置\n- **新 provider**：`hgapi`\n- **baseUrl**：`https://11531817.cc.cd/openai`\n- **model**：`hgapi/gpt-5.4`\n\n### 默认模型\n- **primary**：`hgapi/gpt-5.4`\n\n### fallback\n现在是：\n1. `openai-codex/gpt-5.4`\n2. `arkcode/deepseek-v3.2`\n\n### 状态\n- Provider 已写入配置\n- Primary / fallback 已切换完成\n- Gateway 已重启\n- 当前运行正常，RPC probe 也是 **ok**\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以顺手再做一件事：\n**直接帮你发一条“当前会话实际走 hgapi/gpt-5.4”的真实调用测试**  \n这样不是只看配置，而是验证真正跑通。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bfeee8d5b08191b0f6718733e1c61f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":757,"output":214,"cacheRead":166400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":167371,"cost":{"input":0.0018925,"output":0.00321,"cacheRead":0.0416,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0467025}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774186212938}}
